## Constraints Documentados

| Nombre | Tipo | Regla |
|---|---|---|
| `pk_dim_Calendario` | PRIMARY KEY | `Fecha_Llave` |
| `chk_rango_proyecto` | CHECK | `Fecha_Llave BETWEEN '2022-01-01' AND '2026-12-31'` |
| `chk_mes` | CHECK | `Mes_Numero BETWEEN 1 AND 12` |
| `chk_trimestre` | CHECK | `Trimestre BETWEEN 1 AND 4` |
| `chk_semestre` | CHECK | `Semestre BETWEEN 1 AND 2` |
| `chk_semana` | CHECK | `Numero_Semana BETWEEN 1 AND 53` |
| `chk_dia_semana` | CHECK | `Dia_Semana_Numero BETWEEN 1 AND 7` |
| `chk_ID_Periodo_consistencia` | CHECK | `ID_Periodo = Anio * 100 + Mes_Numero` |
| `chk_es_laborable` | CHECK | `Es_Dia_Laborable IN (0, 1)` |
| `chk_es_feriado` | CHECK | `Es_Feriado IN (0, 1)` |
| `chk_feriado_no_laborable` | CHECK | `Es_Feriado + Es_Dia_Laborable <= 1` |
| `chk_corte_nomina` | CHECK | `Corte_Nomina IN (1, 2) OR NULL` |

